  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bbmaj7]  [Cm7]\n[Dm7]  [Gm7]\n[Ebmaj7]  [Cm7]\n[Cm7/F][F7b9]Look at\n\n[Section A]\n[Bbmaj7]me, I'm as\n[Fm7]helpless as a [Bb7]kitten up a\n[Ebmaj7]tree; And I feel like I'm\n[Ebm9]clingin' to a cloud [Ab13]I\n[Bbmaj7]can't [Gm7]understand I get\n[Cm7]misty, [F13]just holding\n[Bbmaj7]your hand [Cm7]\n[C#m7][F#9]Walk my\n\n[Section A]\n[Bmaj7]way And a\n[F#m7]thousand [B9]violins begin to\n[Emaj7]play Or it might be the\n[Em9]sound of your [A13]hello That\n[B]music I [G#m7]hear I\n[C#m7]get misty, [F#9]the moment you're\n[B6]near [D][C]\n[Bmaj9]Can't you see that you're\n\n[Section B]\n[F#m7]leading me [F#mmaj7]on?\n[F#m7]And it's [Cm/B]just what I\n[Emaj7]want you to [E6]do\n[Emaj7]Don't you [C#m7]notice how\n[Fm7]hopelessly I'm [Bb13]lost\n[Fm7][Bb13]That's why [C#sus2add13]I'm [C#13]follo-\n[F#13]wing you\n[Bm6][D7][C#m7][F#7]On\n\n[Section A]\n[Bmaj9]my own Would I\n[F#m7]wander through this [B13]wonderland a-\n[Emaj7]lone Never knowing my\n[Em9]right foot from my [A13]left My\n[B]hat from my [G#m7]glove I'm too\n[C#m7]misty, [F#9]and too much in\n[D#m7b5]love [G#m7b5]\n[C#m7]Too misty\n\n[Outro]\nAnd\n[Cmaj9]too much\nIn love\n[Bmaj9]",
